<title>UK: Metropolis of Tokyo sets $250 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Metropolis of Tokyo sets $250 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   METROPOLIS OF TOKYO</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    16.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.98     PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.98     SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO    CRS DEFLT  ISSUER ONLY   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
